{"id":"2c2693f4159269f6","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-encoding.md","title":"Effective Finite-Tuple Coding","display":"df-encoding — Effective Finite-Tuple Coding","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-encoding","aliases":["73-df-encoding"],"display":"df-encoding — Effective Finite-Tuple Coding","depends_on":["[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","[[73-df-string-function-computation]]","[[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-encoding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-encoding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-encoding — Effective Finite-Tuple Coding"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fd9e85296ed6a24d\" href=\"?note=fd9e85296ed6a24d\" title=\"73-df-string-function-computation\">73-df-string-function-computation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"004d4e2ba3fdd14e\" href=\"?note=004d4e2ba3fdd14e\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-decision\">73-df-dtm-language-decision</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf2=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbf2=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；有限自然数元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau,\\xi,\\zeta\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\tau,\\xi,\\zeta\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>、二进制词和单字符词采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a> 的类型；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,i,j\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n,i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 是候选函数图；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega})\">\\(S\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 是候选枚举函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lex}\">\\(\\mathrm{lex}\\)</span> 比较元组本身，而不是比较未给定次序的有限集合。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PartialComp}_{\\mathbf2,\\mathbf2}\">\\(\\operatorname{PartialComp}_{\\mathbf2,\\mathbf2}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fd9e85296ed6a24d\" href=\"?note=fd9e85296ed6a24d\" title=\"73-df-string-function-computation\">73-df-string-function-computation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf2}\">\\(\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf2}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"004d4e2ba3fdd14e\" href=\"?note=004d4e2ba3fdd14e\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-decision\">73-df-dtm-language-decision</a>。它们均不依赖程序编码；下述接口不存在以待定义编码解释“可计算”的循环。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TupleRef}\">\\(\\operatorname{TupleRef}\\)</span> 是用来定义有效性的参考表示，不强制后续固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{wordenc}\">\\(\\operatorname{wordenc}\\)</span> 等于该表示。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WordCoding}\">\\(\\operatorname{WordCoding}\\)</span> 不包含任何多项式时间要求。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle1\\rangle^m\">\\(\\langle1\\rangle^m\\)</span> 采用词幂，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；它不是自然数的算术幂 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1^m\">\\(1^m\\)</span>。参考编码的比特串保持不变。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{TupleRef}(\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\langle1\\rangle^{|\\tau|}\\langle0\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}\n\\mathop{\\mathbin{\\frown}}_{i=0}^{|\\tau|-1}(\\langle1\\rangle^{\\tau(i)}\\langle0\\rangle)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{TupleRef}(\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\langle1\\rangle^{|\\tau|}\\langle0\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}\n\\mathop{\\mathbin{\\frown}}_{i=0}^{|\\tau|-1}(\\langle1\\rangle^{\\tau(i)}\\langle0\\rangle)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{TupleRef}:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbf2^*\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{TupleRef}:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbf2^*\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{WordCoding}(c)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists e:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbf2^*\\;\n\\Bigl[c=e\\land\\operatorname{ran}(e)\\in\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf2}\n\\land\\operatorname{PartialComp}_{\\mathbf2,\\mathbf2}\n\\bigl(\\{(\\operatorname{TupleRef}(\\tau),e(\\tau)):\\tau\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\}\\bigr)\n\\land\\operatorname{PartialComp}_{\\mathbf2,\\mathbf2}\n\\bigl(\\{(e(\\tau),\\operatorname{TupleRef}(\\tau)):\\tau\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{WordCoding}(c)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists e:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbf2^*\\;\n\\Bigl[c=e\\land\\operatorname{ran}(e)\\in\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf2}\n\\land\\operatorname{PartialComp}_{\\mathbf2,\\mathbf2}\n\\bigl(\\{(\\operatorname{TupleRef}(\\tau),e(\\tau)):\\tau\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\}\\bigr)\n\\land\\operatorname{PartialComp}_{\\mathbf2,\\mathbf2}\n\\bigl(\\{(e(\\tau),\\operatorname{TupleRef}(\\tau)):\\tau\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{WordCoding}(\\operatorname{TupleRef})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{WordCoding}(\\operatorname{TupleRef})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{lex}\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{(\\xi,\\zeta)\\in(\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega})^2:\n\\bigl(|\\xi|&lt;|\\zeta|\\land(\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,|\\xi|-1\\}\\;\\xi(i)=\\zeta(i))\\bigr)\n\\lor\\bigl(\\exists j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,\\min\\{|\\xi|,|\\zeta|\\}-1\\}\\;\n(\\xi(j)&lt;\\zeta(j)\\land(\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,j-1\\}\\;\\xi(i)=\\zeta(i)))\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{lex}\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{(\\xi,\\zeta)\\in(\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega})^2:\n\\bigl(|\\xi|&lt;|\\zeta|\\land(\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,|\\xi|-1\\}\\;\\xi(i)=\\zeta(i))\\bigr)\n\\lor\\bigl(\\exists j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,\\min\\{|\\xi|,|\\zeta|\\}-1\\}\\;\n(\\xi(j)&lt;\\zeta(j)\\land(\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,j-1\\}\\;\\xi(i)=\\zeta(i)))\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{LexEnumeration}(S,e)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[e:\\{1,\\ldots,|S|\\}\\xrightarrow{\\sim}S\n\\land\\bigl(\\forall i,j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,|S|\\}\\;\\forall\\xi,\\zeta\\in S\\;\n(i&lt;j\\land(i,\\xi)\\in e\\land(j,\\zeta)\\in e\\Longrightarrow(\\xi,\\zeta)\\in\\mathrm{lex})\\bigr)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{LexEnumeration}(S,e)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[e:\\{1,\\ldots,|S|\\}\\xrightarrow{\\sim}S\n\\land\\bigl(\\forall i,j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,|S|\\}\\;\\forall\\xi,\\zeta\\in S\\;\n(i&lt;j\\land(i,\\xi)\\in e\\land(j,\\zeta)\\in e\\Longrightarrow(\\xi,\\zeta)\\in\\mathrm{lex})\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\forall S\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega})\\;\n\\exists!e\\;\\operatorname{LexEnumeration}(S,e)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\forall S\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega})\\;\n\\exists!e\\;\\operatorname{LexEnumeration}(S,e)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本文件按原缺失条目的实际使用位置补齐接口，并不声称恢复了未提供的第 88 本书原文。参考表示先给出元组长度，再逐项给出带终止符的自然数；编码、反解与合法码判定因此均可用原始图灵机语义表达。</p>\n<p>任意满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WordCoding}\">\\(\\operatorname{WordCoding}\\)</span> 的固定编码仍可使用；程序编码不会被强制改成某一个新选的比特串格式。配对编码的具体形式继续由 <code>73-df-binary-program-coding</code> 给出，不能从本文件推断任意有效编码都是多项式时间编码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":